 oledModeNames: 'Enter comma-separated OLED mode names. Numeric mode signals select a displayed entry; string signals display their text. Keep the list aligned with your model’s mode codes and verify a few representative values.',
 oledIndicatorEmojis: 'Choose visual icons for custom OLED status indicators. Each icon is paired with the corresponding indicator variable and label. Keep those arrays aligned when adding/removing rows; an icon alone does not define status logic.',
