 oledIndicatorVarIds: 'Choose the declared live variable for each custom OLED indicator. Keep its mapping paired with its icon and label. A missing mapping does not provide measured status; exercise the variable in Run mode to verify the display.',
 variableIds: 'Choose the mapped variables for the multi-position component. Add Position appends another mapping and remove deletes that position. Keep order and variable types consistent, then test each position in Run mode.',
 hybridValues: 'Configure the value list for the hybrid component. Add Value appends a default and remove deletes a position. Verify that each entered value is compatible with the chosen mapping and that the Run-mode control selects the expected value.',
