action('emoji-picker', 'Choose component emoji', 'onSelect\\(emoji\\)|setIsOpen', 'Open the emoji picker, choose the intended visual symbol and the picker closes after applying it. This changes presentation metadata only. Configure the component’s live variable and value behavior separately.', 'state-machine-simulation');

